Package: cool-raspberries
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Cool Raspberries maintainers <noreply@github.com>
Depends: openjdk-21-jre-headless, adduser, systemd
Homepage: https://github.com/tcox2/cool-raspberries
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Description: Air-conditioner to Modbus RTU gateway
 A Java 21 gateway that exposes multiple serial-connected air conditioners as
 separate devices on one Modbus RTU bus and provides an authenticated HTTPS
 control interface.
